39?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov","html_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":1915,"digest":"sha256:a9e63d4ed373566f579da464948efb71995e9a796c1d6f84b878c16ea5b8018d","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-09-22T21:38:12Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T21:38:12Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/releases/download/v0.85.0/verification.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/tarball/v0.85.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/zipball/v0.85.0","body":"## RevealLine v0.85.0 — safer game-data recovery\n\nGame-data replacement now pauses for an explicit Keep/Replace review before writing. It verifies that the destination and earlier-release source remain unchanged, preserves a verified Undo copy when possible, and keeps pending mastery writes held until the storage outcome is known. Failed or cancelled recovery preserves the current profile. Journey restore also returns keyboard focus to Back before disabling its initiating action.\n\nSource: `f6e592bacda85db5efcf68f5be3ad2240073b661` (tree `15dcbb22f845ad9825316c54321efa22e5a0054e`), merged through [PR #275](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/pull/275).\n\nThe actual merged-source [qualification and freeze](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/35786184530) passed source identity, validation, lint, formatting, native formatting, motion syntax, production reproduction/readiness and the immutable freeze. Automated suites were explicitly waived under the temporary reviewed policy; no passing automated-test verdict is claimed. The preceding [PR build](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/35784264989) passed its preflight and ordinary production build with the same waiver recorded.\n\nThe guarded read-only [artifact inspection](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/35787270298) verified every Git source blob/type/mode and source TAR commit, every distribution manifest byte and hash chain, and the bounded offline inventory. The shipped manifest contains the exact frozen distribution graph.\n\nOriginal distribution: 591,017,758 bytes, SHA-256 `22935ce25164a6239301597cbdba58aa0a9a918432f0e16aadd212ab45e71bbc`.\n\nOriginal source archive: 1,610,905,600 bytes, SHA-256 `067bc28e478196fd085e551108d699388ea7e42bae1918ec01e690f6e31dc5ef`.\n\nPages selection, public byte verification and affected browser journeys remain separate acceptance gates until the selector PR is merged and the deployed site is checked. Physical controllers, physical touch, cold-offline use, full campaign balance and musical/listening acceptance are not claimed by this release package.\n"}